{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01041","headline":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 七 · 刘希夷","name":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北堂红草盛丰茸，南湖碧水照芙蓉。\n朝游暮起金花尽，渐觉罗裳珠露浓。\n自惜妍华三五岁，已叹关山千万重。\n人情一去无还日，欲赠怀芳怨不逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}